docs {
  # MTSS Sample Data > Recovery and Resubmission Scenarios
  
  Certification steps 01-08 delete your records. These `Sync` scripts play the vendor's
  "normal synchronization": they re-POST every removed record with its **latest** values
  (Intervention order first, then the association, then events). Run them after
  certification step 08, then run certification steps 09-14.

  > **Run the scripts one by one, not the whole folder.** The folder holds both the
  > `[PATH 1]` and `[PATH 2]` versions of Sync 1 and Sync 2. Running the folder sends
  > both, and the last one wins: after PATH 1, `Sync 1 - [PATH 2]` restores both staff
  > and certification step 13 fails. Run only the scripts for your path.

  | Script | Run for | Restores |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | Sync 1 - [PATH 1] Intervention 1 | PATH 1 | staffs = first staff only |
  | Sync 1 - [PATH 2] Intervention 1 | PATH 2 | staffs = both staff |
  | Sync 2 - [PATH 1] StudentInterventionAssociation 1 | PATH 1 | dosage 900 |
  | Sync 2 - [PATH 2] StudentInterventionAssociation 1 | PATH 2 | dosage 900, cohortReference |
  | Sync 3 - Event 1, Sync 4 - Event 2, Sync 5 - Event 3, Sync 6 - Event 5 | both | Event 2 with 25 min |
  | Sync 7 - [optional] - Event 6 | both, if you recorded event 6 | Session Not Held |
  | Sync 8 - [PATH 2] StaffCohortAssociation 1 | PATH 2 | endDate 2026-12-18 |
}
